---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import {venture} from '../data/venture';
---
<section class="venture-map"><div class="map-intro"><p class="eyebrow">STARTUP ADVISORY / THE ENGAGEMENT PATH</p><h2>From an early idea<br/>to an executable plan.</h2><p>Seven connected stages of advisory and venture-building support. Choose the right starting point, agree responsibilities and move forward as the evidence supports the next commitment.</p></div><ol class="launch-path">{venture.stages.map((s,i)=><li><a href={`/venture-studio/journey/#stage-${i+1}`}><span class="stage-orb"><Icon name={s.icon}/></span><small>0{i+1}</small><strong>{s.title}</strong><span>{s.output}</span><Icon name="arrowUpRight"/></a></li>)}</ol><div class="learning-loop"><Icon name="flask"/><span>Observe → form a hypothesis → run a small test → review evidence → choose the next step.</span></div></section>
<style>.venture-map{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at top right,#24567e,transparent 65%),#102744;border-radius:16px;padding:36px;color:#e4eef9;overflow:hidden}.map-intro{max-width:750px}.map-intro .eyebrow{color:#9ddcec}.map-intro h2{color:#fff;font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.5rem)}.map-intro p:last-child{color:#c4d6e8;font-size:.88rem;margin-top:18px}.launch-path{list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;padding:0;margin:30px 0}.launch-path li{min-width:0}.launch-path a{display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:relative;height:100%;padding:20px;border:1px solid #ffffff25;background:#ffffff08;border-radius:10px;transition:background .15s}.launch-path a:hover{background:#ffffff15}.stage-orb{display:grid;place-items:center;width:46px;height:46px;background:#8fe3d913;color:#9ce7dd;border:1px solid #8fe3d94a;border-radius:12px}.stage-orb :global(.icon){width:23px;height:23px}.launch-path small{margin:14px 0 7px;color:#a2c9df;font-size:.59rem}.launch-path strong{font-size:.9rem;color:#fff;font-weight:500}.launch-path a>span:last-of-type{font-size:.68rem;color:#afc9dd;margin-top:9px}.launch-path a>:global(.icon){position:absolute;right:15px;top:20px;width:17px;color:#99b8d2}.learning-loop{display:flex;gap:13px;border-top:1px solid #ffffff25;padding-top:22px;color:#b5d9e6;font-size:.78rem}.learning-loop :global(.icon){flex:none;color:#a1e3d6}@media(max-width:850px){.launch-path{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:480px){.venture-map{padding:25px 19px}.launch-path{gap:10px}.launch-path a{padding:15px}.launch-path strong{font-size:.8rem}.launch-path a>:global(.icon){right:10px;top:14px}}</style>
